{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban airport charging for drop off and pickup",
        "additional_details": "Having recently picked up two family members at 01:00, I was charged \u00a36.60 for being in a pick-up area for less than 4 minutes.",
        "background": "We want the Government to remove charges for picking up or dropping off at airports. We believe it's taking advantage of the public and the first 10 minutes should be free.",
